# Dack Fayden +1: "Target player draws two cards, then discards two cards." The target player chooses what to discard,
# not Dack's controller. Turn 1 Bot1 casts Dack off Black Lotus and a Volcanic Island and targets Bot2: it draws two
# Islands and keeps its Lightning Bolt and Counterspell out of the graveyard by its own choice. Dack ends at 4 loyalty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Volcanic Island
Black Lotus
Dack Fayden
Island x4
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island x5
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Volcanic Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Volcanic Island.Activate(Ability: Add {U})
Bot1.Hand.Dack Fayden.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Dack Fayden.Activate(Bot2; Ability: draws two)
Bot2.Choose(Island; Island)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Dack Fayden.Counters.Loyalty = 4
Bot2.Hand = Lightning Bolt; Counterspell; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot2.Graveyard = Island; Island
Bot2.Library.Count = 11
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
